# [rc4l] Build context for Dockerfile.game-server. BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore in
# preference to the root .dockerignore, which excludes everything (that one serves
# Dockerfile.linux-build, whose image is a toolchain with the source mounted at runtime).
#
# [rc4l] Allowlist rather than denylist, as Dockerfile.registry.dockerignore is: start from nothing and name what the build reads.
*

# [rc4l] The staged server and the two files the runtime stage copies beside it; the compile happens before docker build, so no source enters the context.
!dist-prebuilt
!config/waddownloadsites.txt
!scripts/game-server-entrypoint.sh
